I understand completely now. You are getting null or raw IDs in the UI because the **getAllRequestsSummary** SQL query in your VoucherRequestServiceImpl.java is still joined to the old JOURNAL_BATCH_MASTER table, and it is **missing the VID_FK column** and the USERS join for the creator name.
To get the exact same look and data as the Authorization screen, we need to update that specific SQL query.
### 1. Update the Backend SQL (VoucherRequestServiceImpl.java)
**FIND getAllRequestsSummary (around line 720) and REPLACE it with this exact code:**
```java
    public List<Map<String, Object>> getAllRequestsSummary() {
        String sql = """
            SELECT 
                p.BATCH_ID, 
                p.VID_FK,
                p.CREATED_BY AS CREATOR_ID, 
                COALESCE(u.FIRST_NAME || ' ' || u.LAST_NAME, p.CREATED_BY) AS CREATOR_NAME,
                p.CREATED_AT AS REQ_DATE, 
                p.RECORDS_COUNT AS TOTAL_ROWS, 
                p.BATCH_STATUS, 
                w.WORKFLOW_STAGE, 
                w.WORKFLOW_CODE
            FROM VOUCHER_POSTING p
            LEFT JOIN WORKFLOW_TRANSITIONS w ON p.PENDING_AT = w.WORKFLOW_ID
            LEFT JOIN USERS u ON p.CREATED_BY = u.USER_ID
            ORDER BY p.CREATED_AT DESC
        """;

        return jdbcTemplate.query(sql, (rs, rowNum) -> {
            Map<String, Object> map = new HashMap<>();
            map.put("batchId", rs.getString("BATCH_ID"));
            map.put("vid", rs.getString("VID_FK")); // Added VID
            map.put("creatorId", rs.getString("CREATOR_ID"));
            map.put("creatorName", rs.getString("CREATOR_NAME")); // Added Name
            map.put("requestDate", rs.getTimestamp("REQ_DATE"));
            map.put("requestCount", rs.getLong("TOTAL_ROWS"));
            map.put("approvalWorkflow", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_CODE"));
            map.put("workflowState", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_STAGE")); // Added for Stepper

            String bStatus = rs.getString("BATCH_STATUS");
            if ("R".equals(bStatus)) map.put("currentStatus", "REJECTED");
            else if ("A".equals(bStatus) || "C".equals(bStatus)) map.put("currentStatus", "POSTED");
            else map.put("currentStatus", rs.getString("WORKFLOW_STAGE") || "PENDING");

            return map;
        });
    }

```
